---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---
<p class="sign">Nothing here is for sale.</p>

<img class="doodle doodle--bubbles" src="/img/doodle-bubbles.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true">

<section class="register" aria-label="Taped up by the register">
  <blockquote class="taped">
    <p>“It was an individual heart. It was already at its work of beginning at the beginning.”</p>
    <cite>Rainer Maria Rilke, <i>The Notebooks of Malte Laurids Brigge</i></cite>
  </blockquote>
  <blockquote class="taped">
    <p>“Why do they always teach us that it’s easy and evil to do what we want and that we need to restrain ourselves? It’s the hardest thing in the world — to do what we want.”</p>
    <cite>Ayn Rand, <i>The Fountainhead</i></cite>
  </blockquote>
  <blockquote class="taped">
    <p>“The sound of silence is all the instruction you’ll get.”</p>
    <cite>Jack Kerouac, <i>Desolation Angels</i></cite>
  </blockquote>
</section>

<img class="doodle doodle--blob" src="/img/doodle-blob.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true">

<nav class="aisles" aria-label="Aisles">
  <button data-aisle="all" aria-pressed="true">everything</button>
  <button data-aisle="journal">journal</button>
  <button data-aisle="practice">practices</button>
  <button data-aisle="rec">recs</button>
  <button data-aisle="listening">listening</button>
</nav>

<ol class="shelf">
  {%- for item in collections.shelf %}
  <li class="item item--{{ item.data.aisle }}" data-aisle="{{ item.data.aisle }}">
    <span class="aisle-tag">{{ item.data.aisle }}</span>

    {%- if item.data.aisle == "journal" %}
    <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="journal-link">
      <img src="{{ item.data.scan }}" alt="{{ item.content | striptags | truncate(300) }}" loading="lazy">
      <span class="item-title">{{ item.data.title }}</span>
    </a>

    {%- elif item.data.aisle == "practice" %}
    <span class="item-title">{{ item.data.title }}</span>
    <div class="practice-body">{{ item.content | safe }}</div>
    {%- if item.data.from %}<a class="practice-from" href="{{ item.data.from }}">from the journal →</a>{% endif %}

    {%- elif item.data.aisle == "listening" %}
    <span class="item-title">{{ item.data.title }}</span>
    <div class="embed">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ item.data.youtube }}" title="{{ item.data.title }}" loading="lazy" allow="encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
    <p class="note">{{ item.data.note }}</p>

    {%- else %}
    <div class="rec">
      {%- if item.data.logo %}<a href="{{ item.data.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img class="rec-logo" src="{{ item.data.logo }}" alt="{{ item.data.title }} logo"></a>{% endif %}
      <div>
        <a href="{{ item.data.link }}" class="item-title" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.data.title }}</a>
        <p class="note">{{ item.data.note }}</p>
        {%- if item.data.where %}<p class="where">{{ item.data.where }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
    <time class="stocked" datetime="{{ item.date | htmlDateString }}">stocked {{ item.date | stockedDate }}</time>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ol>

<a class="stockroom-door" href="/stockroom/" title="the stockroom">
  <img src="/img/doodle-door.png" alt="A hand-drawn door to the stockroom">
  <span>stockroom</span>
</a>

<script src="/js/aisles.js" defer></script>
